    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72261" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκεί-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, in pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>private</i> or <i>family affairs,</i>
